Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 19:18:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(u1): rebuild Home to the v5 reference (official +
 community rails)

Port the locked v5 Home frame: own home-top (city + alerts bell, no generic
header via hideHeader), hero, Set-an-alert CTA, protected-payment trust band,
Official/Community segment + genre chips, Official Notify-me rail (demo content
until the catalog backend lands), and a Community rail wired to the real mock
listing (links to the detail page, keeping the buy flow live).

Acceptance harness /app/home assertions updated to the v5 content.
Verified live: all components present, real listing wired, no overflow; astro
check 0 errors, 159 tests pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
